step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple robust mean combination over the full model pool to gauge baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination using inverse error weights to see if it beats the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination over the full pool to see if a robust central tendency beats the weighted inverse-error approach.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with the top-ranked model DWT_rf to see if a single best model outperforms the robust combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"DWT_rf"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled meta‑model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a learned weighting improves over inverse‑error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if removing extremes improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated robust method can beat the current best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on a smaller, more diverse pool (pool1) to see if reduced model set improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse-error combination on pool2 to see if a slightly larger pool improves over pool1 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if reducing noise improves the score.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the high‑performing pool1 to see if the median can beat the current best single.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool2 to see if a larger high‑performing pool improves over pool1 mean and best single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

